(MARGIN CALL) Tj
T*
(Deficit is exposure minus rounded collateral value. A call is issued only when the deficit) Tj
T*
(is strictly greater than 20. A deficit equal to 20 is logged but not called. The transfer) Tj
T*
(due on a call is the entire deficit, not just the portion above 20. The minimum transfer) Tj
T*
(threshold is a trigger, not a deductible.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(VALUATION EXERCISE) Tj
T*
(Exposure is 1,000. Collateral consists of a long sovereign bond worth 500 and a) Tj
T*
(watch-listed approved corporate bond worth 500. Both have valid quotes. There are no other) Tj
T*
(securities, cash credits or pending transfers. A transfer accepted after the call is) Tj
T*
(reconciled as a new movement; it is not assumed in this snapshot.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CALL TIMING) Tj
T*
(A call delivered by 11:00 inclusive is due at 15:00 on the same business day. A later call) Tj
T*
(is due at 10:00 on the next business day. Delivery means receipt in the agreed margin) Tj
T*
(inbox, not when an analyst began drafting. A call disputed before its deadline remains due) Tj
T*
(for its undisputed amount; the disputed part is escalated to both valuation leads.) Tj
T*
() Tj
ET
