(SUBSTITUTION CONTROL) Tj
T*
(A substitution requires prior counterparty consent and receipt of eligible replacement) Tj
T*
(collateral with adjusted value at least equal to the value released. The old security is) Tj
T*
(released only after custody confirms receipt. An email promising delivery is insufficient.) Tj
T*
(During a feed outage no substitution using an unquoted replacement is allowed, even if its) Tj
T*
(face value exceeds the old security's value.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(VERSION CONTROL) Tj
T*
(OR-5 used a flat 10% haircut on approved corporate bonds without a watch-list add-on. OR-6) Tj
T*
(replaces that rule for every valuation dated on or after 2026-10-01, including trades) Tj
T*
(opened earlier. Sovereign haircuts are unchanged. An old trade date does not preserve the) Tj
T*
(OR-5 corporate haircut.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
